#: ../../administration/logging/log_forwarding.rst:96
msgid "Appliance Service Logs"
msgstr "Logs de servicios del dispositivo"

#: ../../administration/logging/log_forwarding.rst:98
msgid ""
"Appliance-level service logs (MySQL, RabbitMQ, OpenSearch, Nginx, "
"application logs) are **not** forwarded by the Agent-based syslog rules. "
"To forward appliance logs, configure syslog forwarding at the OS level "
"using ``rsyslog`` or ``syslog-ng`` on the appliance host, or use the "
"logback SIEM appender configuration. See :doc:`appliance_logs` for "
"details."
msgstr "Los logs de servicios a nivel de dispositivo (MySQL, RabbitMQ, OpenSearch, Nginx, logs de aplicación) **no** se reenvían mediante las reglas syslog basadas en el Agente. Para reenviar logs del dispositivo, configure el reenvío syslog a nivel del SO mediante ``rsyslog`` o ``syslog-ng`` en el host del dispositivo, o use la configuración del appender SIEM de logback. Consulte :doc:`appliance_logs` para obtener detalles."

#: ../../administration/logging/log_forwarding.rst:101
msgid "Integration with SIEM Platforms"
msgstr "Integración con plataformas SIEM"

#: ../../administration/logging/log_forwarding.rst:103
msgid ""
"For SIEM integration (CEF/LEEF format, structured audit events), "
"|morpheus| supports a logback-based audit appender that can write "
"directly to SIEM databases or syslog endpoints in Common Event Format. "
"This is configured at the appliance level rather than through the UI "
"forwarding rules. See the CEF/SIEM Auditing section in "
":doc:`appliance_logs`."
msgstr "Para integración SIEM (formato CEF/LEEF, eventos de auditoría estructurados), |morpheus| admite un appender de auditoría basado en logback que puede escribir directamente en bases de datos SIEM o endpoints syslog en Common Event Format. Esto se configura a nivel del dispositivo en lugar de mediante las reglas de reenvío de la interfaz de usuario. Consulte la sección CEF/SIEM Auditing en :doc:`appliance_logs`."

